			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild Worker configuration indentation\n\nFlatten the indentation in Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js by removing extra indentation levels from the configuration object and catch block. The export object and plugins array now use 0-space indentation instead of 2-space nesting.\n\nThis aligns with the project's formatting preferences for ESBuild configuration files.",
