			],
			"Message": "refactor(Worker): Wrap service worker registration in IIFE with early return\n\nRefactor Source/Worker/Register.ts to use an Immediately Invoked Function Expression pattern with early return instead of two separate conditional blocks. This consolidates the service worker registration logic into a single flow.\n\nKey changes:\n- Wrap all registration logic in `void ((): void => { ... })();` IIFE\n- Move service worker API check inside the function with early return\n- Update navigation logic to use `window.location.replace(Scope)` when navigating into SW scope, only falling back to `window.location.reload()` when already in scope\n- Add scope path check before navigation to avoid unnecessary reloads\n\nNo functional changes intended - this is a code organization improvement for better readability and maintenance.",
			"SHA": "de28f101742242cc41305015b1c23c364f535224"
		},
